---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Developer building automation, local-first tools, and AI. Based in Portland.">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[65ch] px-6 py-20">
    <div class="border border-terracotta/30 rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12">
      <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
        <img
          src="/images/tarlow-cropped-headshot-small.jpg"
          alt="Tarlow"
          class="w-32 h-32 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-terracotta/20"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About</h1>
      <div class="mt-4 h-0.5 w-12 rounded bg-terracotta"></div>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
        <p>Hello, I'm Tarlow. I've been building things since I was a kid - it started with modding consoles, then computers, then websites - and I haven't really stopped since.</p>
          <p>
            My career started in internet marketing and web development, and I quickly fell in
            love with automation - taking a repetitive, annoying task and making it disappear.
            In 2014 that turned into BoosterBots, a software company where I built Windows
            automation tools for internet marketers, the Poshmark Booster among others, plus
            custom automation for businesses that needed things off-the-shelf tools couldn't do.
            I spent years designing, shipping, and supporting desktop software for paying
            customers, and it taught me more about building real products than anything I've
            done since.
          </p>
          <p>
            After years of that, I stepped back. The tools worked - that wasn't the problem.
            The problem was I was building software that fought the platforms it ran on, and I
            didn't want to spend my life doing that. I wanted to make things that are
            legitimately useful and won't get shut down.
          </p>
          <p>
            So I took a real break, not a vacation. I spent a lot of time outdoors, in nature,
            focused on things that had nothing to do with money - my mind, my body, reconnecting
            with everything around me. It was a revealing time, a vulnerable one, and honestly a
            scary one at times. But I found more of myself in that time, enough to grow, and I
            came back wanting to help other people grow too, and to work in a purer way.
          </p>
          <p>
            What I came back with is Moss AI Studio - my one-man shop for local-first,
            privacy-respecting tools. Same builder, same love of automation, but now I build
            things I can stand behind: CopySprout, an AI writing tool for Etsy sellers,
            Handmade Checker, a Chrome extension that spots AI-generated listings, and
            IndieGameScout, an itch.io stats tracker. When I'm not working on my own products,
            I take on custom builds and automation projects through the studio - turning clunky
            processes into clean, working systems for people who'd rather not fight their own
            software. If you want the full story of how I got from there to here, I wrote it all
            out in
            <a href="https://mossaistudio.com/blog/the-story-behind-moss-ai-studio/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-terracotta no-underline hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">The Story Behind Moss AI Studio</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            When I'm not at a keyboard, I'm usually in PNW - camping, fishing, or running
            with my dog on the beach. I tinker with local AI models at home for fun, and I love
            learning. Most of what I learn ends up here on the blog.
          </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 border border-terracotta/30 rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Let's Connect</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[1.0625rem] text-ink/70">
        Interested in working together or just want to chat?
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
        <a
          href="mailto:tarlow@mossaistudio.com"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-terracotta text-paper font-serif text-lg no-underline hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
        >
          Send me an Email
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://mossaistudio.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-[#22c55e] text-white font-serif text-lg no-underline hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
        >
          Visit Moss AI Studio
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
